Financial Analytics & Dashboards

This section showcases selected dashboard and business analytics projects focused on performance measurement, data visualisation, and evidence-based business interpretation.

Featured Projects

1. Commercial Performance Intelligence
Focus:Price, Volume and Mix (PVM) analysis.

Examines commercial performance drivers through dashboard-based analysis. Key findings and business implications will be documented after validating the underlying report and data.

 2. Financial Analytics Group Dashboard
Focus: Financial data visualisation and performance indicators.

Showcases the use of dashboard visuals and KPIs to organise financial information and support analytical interpretation.

 3. Construction Sector Performance Dashboard
Focus:Sector-level performance analysis.

Presents sector-related performance information through dashboard visualisation, subject to verification of the underlying workbook and metrics.

4. ESG Performance Scorecard
Focus: Cross-company ESG comparison.

Organises environmental, social, and governance indicators for comparative analysis. Conclusions will be based on the scorecard's actual methodology and data.
 Analytical Skills

- Dashboard design and data visualisation
- KPI selection and performance monitoring
- Comparative and trend analysis
- Business interpretation and insight development
- Data validation and recognition of analytical limitations

Evidence and Interpretation

Each project will include its supporting file, analytical objective, verified findings, business interpretation, and learning outcomes where applicable.

Numerical claims and conclusions will be added only after reviewing the underlying project data.
